  "h1": "Exterior Painting Portfolio",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2>Exterior Painting Portfolio</h2><p><strong>Residential Exterior Projects | The Proud Paintbrush</strong></p><p>Our exterior painting portfolio highlights completed projects that showcase durable finishes, consistent preparation, and attention to detail across a wide range of exterior surfaces.</p><p>These examples help homeowners see how our exterior work improves curb appeal while protecting homes from weather, moisture, and long-term wear.</p><h2>Exterior Painting Projects</h2><p>Below are examples of exterior painting projects completed by The Proud Paintbrush, including:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/exterior-painters\">Full exterior repaints</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/stucco-maintenance/stucco-painting\">Stucco, brick, and siding painting</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/brick-painting\">Limewash brick finishes</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/garage-door-painting\">Garage doors</a> and exterior trim</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/fence-staining\">Fence </a>and <a href=\"/exterior-painting/deck-painting-and-staining\">deck staining</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://patio\">Patio ceilings and outdoor living spaces</a></p></li></ul><p>Each project reflects our focus on surface preparation, proper product selection, and clean execution.</p><h2>What You’ll Notice in Our Exterior Work</h2><p>As you browse our exterior portfolio, pay attention to:</p><ul><li><p>Even coverage and consistent color</p></li><li><p>Clean lines on trim and architectural details</p></li><li><p>Proper preparation on stucco, brick, and siding</p></li><li><p>Finishes designed to hold up to sun and moisture</p></li><li><p>A cohesive, finished look across the entire exterior</p></li></ul><p>These details are what allow exterior paint to perform well over time instead of failing prematurely.</p><h2>Looking for More Details About Exterior Painting?</h2><p>If you’d like to learn more about our exterior painting process, materials, or what to expect during a project, you can explore the page below.</p><p><a href=\"/painting-services/exterior-painting\">→ <strong>Explore Exterior Painting Services</strong></a></p><h2>Exterior Portfolio FAQs</h2><p><strong>What types of exterior projects are shown in this portfolio?</strong><br> This portfolio includes full-home exteriors, stucco and brick painting, limewash finishes, fences, decks, garage doors, and exterior trim.</p><p><strong>Do you include before-and-after photos?</strong><br> Yes. Many exterior projects include before-and-after images to show the transformation and overall impact.</p><p><strong>Are these photos from real projects?</strong><br> Yes. All images shown are from completed exterior painting projects handled by The Proud Paintbrush.</p>",
